    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d538">

                <pb facs="0590" n="474" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg474"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1220.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-27T18:00:00-04:49">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 27, 1915—6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Commandant of arrondissement of the Government murdered about 70 political
                    prisoners in their cells before giving up <pb facs="0591" n="475" xml:id="pg475"
                    /> prison and was himself killed. Great excitement and intense feeling as a
                    result.</p>
                <p>It has been confirmed that the President is in French Legation.</p>
                <p>I have communicated situation to Admiral Caperton.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
